{
  "info": {
    "name": "KSA - Wallet-to-Wallet Transfers",
    "description": "Wallet-to-wallet P2P transfer demo.\n\n**Architecture (updated 2026-05-05 — ledger-service is now the single Fineract bridge):**\n- wallet-service no longer talks to Fineract directly\n- ALL Fineract calls route through `ledger-service /internal/fineract-proxy/savings/**`\n- ledger-service handles: idempotency, audit log (SAMA 7-yr), Fineract auth\n- Fineract holds: balances + GL + every transaction (single source of truth)\n- wallet-service stores: transfer audit + idempotency + wallet metadata\n- Mobile-based recipient lookup via identity-service\n\n**Call path:**\n```\nClient → Kong → wallet-service\n                  ↓ (LedgerFineractSavingsClient SDK)\n                ledger-service /internal/fineract-proxy/savings/**\n                  ↓ (FineractGateway)\n                Fineract /savingsaccounts/**\n```\n\n**Demo wallets** (real Keycloak users, all in CompanyRealm):\n- Wallet A: NID 1010219431 / PIN 147852  →  +966561343161  (savings 146)\n- Wallet B: NID 1211111111 / PIN 147852  →  +966591591591  (savings 150)\n- Wallet C: NID 1234567010 / PIN 147852  →  +966555687010  (savings 108, FROZEN)\n\n**Tenant**: 00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000001\n**Realm**: CompanyRealm\n\nRun the requests in order — first \"0. Login\" auto-sets the JWT, then everything else uses it.\n\n**🔍 Ledger Proxy folder**: contains direct calls to the new ledger-service proxy endpoints — no JWT required (internal). Use these to verify the audit trail and prove all Fineract calls flow through ledger-service.",
    "schema": "https://schema.getpostman.com/json/collection/v2.1.0/collection.json"
  },
  "variable": [
    { "key": "baseUrl", "value": "http://46.62.226.94:8000/wallet-service", "description": "via Kong (recommended)" },
    { "key": "identityUrl", "value": "http://46.62.226.94:8000/identity-service" },
    { "key": "directUrl", "value": "http://localhost:8088", "description": "wallet-service direct (bypass Kong)" },
    { "key": "ledgerUrl", "value": "http://46.62.226.94:8000/ledger-service", "description": "ledger-service via Kong — works for both /api/v1/** (JWT) and /internal/** (no JWT) paths" },
    { "key": "ledgerInternalUrl", "value": "http://46.62.226.94:8000/ledger-service", "description": "Same as ledgerUrl when going via Kong. For local-only direct access, change to http://localhost:8095" },
    { "key": "jwt", "value": "", "description": "auto-set by login request" },
    { "key": "tenantId", "value": "00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000001" },
    { "key": "walletA", "value": "22a7defd-c377-4239-bd68-a40dfb632ae8" },
    { "key": "walletB", "value": "43564271-7ea5-4047-b36f-79afeb5d07fe" },
    { "key": "walletC", "value": "9155a581-cccd-4e95-83ca-a17186521168" },
    { "key": "savingsA", "value": "146", "description": "Fineract savings ID for Wallet A" },
    { "key": "savingsB", "value": "150", "description": "Fineract savings ID for Wallet B" },
    { "key": "nidA", "value": "1010219431" },
    { "key": "nidB", "value": "1211111111" },
    { "key": "mobileA", "value": "+966561343161" },
    { "key": "mobileB", "value": "+966591591591" },
    { "key": "mobileC", "value": "+966555687010" },
    { "key": "lastTransferId", "value": "" }
  ],
  "auth": {
    "type": "bearer",
    "bearer": [{ "key": "token", "value": "{{jwt}}" }]
  },
  "item": [
    {
      "name": "0. Login as Wallet A owner (auto-sets {{jwt}})",
      "event": [
        {
          "listen": "test",
          "script": {
            "exec": [
              "const resp = pm.response.json();",
              "const data = resp.data || resp;",
              "if (data.accessToken) {",
              "    pm.collectionVariables.set('jwt', data.accessToken);",
              "    console.log('JWT set: ' + data.accessToken.substring(0, 20) + '...');",
              "}",
              "pm.test('Login OK', () => pm.response.to.have.status(200));",
              "pm.test('Token returned', () => pm.expect(data.accessToken).to.not.be.empty);"
            ],
            "type": "text/javascript"
          }
        }
      ],
      "request": {
        "auth": { "type": "noauth" },
        "method": "POST",
        "header": [
          { "key": "Content-Type", "value": "application/json" },
          { "key": "X-Device-Id", "value": "postman-demo-A" }
        ],
        "body": {
          "mode": "raw",
          "raw": "{\n  \"nationalId\": \"{{nidA}}\",\n  \"pin\": \"147852\"\n}"
        },
        "url": "{{identityUrl}}/api/v1/auth/login-with-pin",
        "description": "Login as NID 1010219431 / PIN 147852. Returns JWT auto-saved into {{jwt}}.\nFor logging in as Wallet B owner: change nationalId to {{nidB}} (1211111111)."
      }
    },
    {
      "name": "1. Balance — Wallet A (BEFORE) [proxied via ledger-service]",
      "event": [
        {
          "listen": "test",
          "script": {
            "exec": [
              "pm.test('200 OK', () => pm.response.to.have.status(200));",
              "const d = pm.response.json().data;",
              "console.log('Wallet A balance:', d.availableBalance, d.currency);",
              "console.log('Audit row will be visible at: GET ledger-service /api/v1/fineract-proxy/audit?caller=wallet-service (when implemented)');"
            ],
            "type": "text/javascript"
          }
        }
      ],
      "request": {
        "method": "GET",
        "header": [],
        "url": "{{baseUrl}}/api/v1/wallets/{{walletA}}/balance",
        "description": "wallet-service → LedgerFineractSavingsClient SDK → ledger-service /internal/fineract-proxy/savings/accounts/{savingsId} → Fineract.\nEvery call audited in ledger_db.fineract_audit_log."
      }
    },
    {
