    {
      "name": "🔧 Verification SQL (informational)",
      "description": "Reference SQL queries for verifying the audit trail and idempotency cache. These are not Postman requests — copy and run against the ledger_db PostgreSQL instance.\n\n```sql\n-- 1. Recent Fineract proxy calls\nSELECT operation, fineract_endpoint, response_status, caller_service, duration_ms, occurred_at\nFROM fineract_audit_log\nORDER BY occurred_at DESC\nLIMIT 20;\n\n-- 2. Calls that originated from wallet-service (proves the migration works)\nSELECT operation, fineract_endpoint, response_status, COUNT(*) AS calls,\n       AVG(duration_ms)::int AS avg_ms\nFROM fineract_audit_log\nWHERE caller_service = 'wallet-service'\nGROUP BY operation, fineract_endpoint, response_status\nORDER BY calls DESC;\n\n-- 3. Idempotency cache contents\nSELECT idempotency_key, operation, cached_status, expires_at\nFROM fineract_proxy_idempotency\nORDER BY created_at DESC\nLIMIT 10;\n\n-- 4. Failed Fineract calls in the last hour\nSELECT operation, fineract_endpoint, response_status, error_message, occurred_at\nFROM fineract_audit_log\nWHERE response_status >= 400\n  AND occurred_at > NOW() - INTERVAL '1 hour'\nORDER BY occurred_at DESC;\n```\n\n**Run via:** `docker exec ksa-postgres psql -U postgres -d ledger_db -c \"<sql>\"`",
      "item": []
    }
